9.19.296.m:
He should not mount a vehicle;
he should not climb a tree;
he should not descend into a well;

he should not hold an umbrella;
he should not wear shoes;
he should not sleep on a couch;

9.20.297.m:
He should observe this vow for a year;
for a vow does not go beyond a year.
Indeed, during this very year he should study.
